P18-02 typed-header regression found during full test refresh
- `mvn -o -q -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify` passed at baseline
  `d030c74d2be4404db8ee2ac5323ab6bc44f5d8ff`: 37 scenarios, Java decoded 106
  Rust-generated frames and 19 Rust typed body fixtures.
- Default workspace tests at that baseline exposed an unhandled header family
  in `query_admin_header_reflection_modes_match_invoked_java_551` and malformed
  optional integer behavior for GetAllSubscriptionGroup headers.
- Added fast/reflection decode-and-reencode checks for GetAllSubscriptionGroup
  request/response and QueryConsumeQueue request headers. Updated malformed
  optional integer decoding to match the pinned Java fixture. Fixture SHA-256:
  `ce98f356e351ec5028e8f01f2ba36612306a4559278006599e8c44ff125b9766`.
- Focused regression now passes:
  `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-remoting --lib
  query_admin_header_reflection_modes_match_invoked_java_551 --locked`.
- Full default/all-feature workspace refresh is running again after this fix.

